# Objective
uplink-anomaly-generator-hacker-name = Plasmic Hypercapacitive Power Cage
uplink-anomaly-generator-hacker-desc = A care package of dangerously compressed plasma and nefarious electric equipment, made to overload the anomaly generator, lovingly wrapped in the cheapest metal shell the Syndicate could bother sparing.

uplink-gravity-generator-hacker-name = Reconfigured θ' Reconfigurator
uplink-gravity-generator-hacker-desc = A NanoTrasen manufactured repair tool, appropriated by the Syndicate to impair the gravity generator. It should be obvious where to plug it in, once you get past the maintenance panel and security mesh.

uplink-mailbox-hacker-name = 1337 Mailbox Autohacker
uplink-mailbox-hacker-desc = Automatically hijacks NanoTrasen bluespace mailboxes and takes advantage of their hardware to transfer funds to the Syndicate. Simply jam it into the circuit board and wait for one (1) minute for it to do it's magic.

